  "title": "MySQL: Fix warning about incomplete dissector",
  "description": "This fixes the \"FIXME - dissector is incomplete\" warning for packet 29 and 52.\n\nDuring the first pass the offset returned by `mysql_dissect_field_packet` is 34 and during the second pass it is 35.\n\n![image](/uploads/27e575e042caa19ea2e3c6c3ebe9841a/image.png)\n\nExample packets, use \"decode as...\" to decode port 8032 as MySQL\n[mysql.pcap](/uploads/21d00027f3d55deff4001651e29eda60/mysql.pcap)\n\n![image](/uploads/ce458369b15633f44922755e83d3653e/image.png)",
